# Build-time configuration for the ANDROID bundle only.
#
# `vite build --mode android` loads this file (see the `android:sync` script).
# `.env.local` — which a developer machine points at the development deployment
# — is overridden by a mode file, and that matters here: the APK uses one fixed
# backend for its whole installed life, so it must be the SAME deployment the
# website uses. A phone build that quietly targeted the dev deployment meant a
# signed-in account there had no history, playlist or likes on the site, and the
# OAuth providers configured for production never matched.
#
# This is a public address (the Convex client URL is embedded in every web
# bundle), never a secret.
VITE_CONVEX_URL=https://graceful-jaguar-949.convex.cloud
